HST Office: opening a very large Writer file gives no hint that it may take long or not open at
all on a 16 GB machine. When a .docx, .doc or .odt over 100 MB opens editable and visible, a
warning bar names its size and the limits, with [Close]. Hidden, read-only, preview and embedded
Test only: the large-file warning tests without the warning.

